 },
 "sprite_review": {
  "score": 7.5,
  "problems": [
   "At a glance it reads clearly as a clam with a pearl: wavy two-part shell, charcoal outside, pale inside with a gold edge, and a pearl in the middle. The edges are cleanly cut out.",
   "Next to the person it reaches about knee height, which is right. It still feels a little small and flat to be a 'giant' clam: the open shell is wide but low.",
   "The inside of the shell is nearly pure white and is the brightest thing in the shot, brighter than the person's shirt. It pulls the eye away from the character and is a bit cool for the house look (charcoal, brushed metal, gold).",
   "There is no visible contact shadow under the bottom shell, so on the floor it looks slightly pasted on instead of resting on the reef."
  ]
 }
}